  "description": "Release and operate the result of a specification whose stories are delivered: build a release with provenance, run the ESS conformance suite of the current specification revision against it, publish it on a person's approval, and observe it running. The ESS gate must pass on the current specification revision. A revised specification invalidates the conformance runs observed against the earlier revision. The case ends passed (operating), rolled back on a complete rollback result, or withheld on an explicit decision.",
